            "type": "tier1Summary",
            "gameTick": 195,
            "text": "Dorian Vael warns Tsukiko Kuzunoha that failure to answer his questions will result in her being judged a trespasser. Lilessa the Ashen Empress dismisses Dorian's rigidity, expressing amusement and interest in Tsukiko for challenging the court's protocol. An adjudicator marks a tally regarding the encounter.",
            "lastUsedTick": 213,
            "score": 0.44538150160593143
          },
          {
            "type": "tier1Summary",
            "gameTick": 196,
            "text": "Tsukiko Kuzunoha calmly challenged Dorian Vael's authority, arguing that his orders were flawed since he is not the Empress. Dorian conceded the point and invited Tsukiko to propose a corrected protocol for her questioning. Lilessa the Ashen Empress expressed amusement and encouraged Tsukiko to further dismantle her court's dignity.",
