            "gameTick": 200,
            "text": "Tsukiko Kuzunoha requested that her human companions be fed and rested while she began the trial immediately to avoid wasting time. Lilessa the Ashen Empress agreed, and Dorian Vael had guards escort Tiran Gale and Elian Cross to the guest quarters. An adjudicator signaled the start of the test as Lilessa led Tsukiko toward the Descent of Discernment.",
