    "Anime Fantasy": {
      "name": "Anime Fantasy",
      "basicInfo": "## Basic Info\nA world governed by light-novel logic — Adventurers' Guild branches on every corner, color-coded mana, cute slimes and terrifying demon beasts, a Demon Lord whose name is whispered in every tavern, and hot springs in convenient cave systems. Royal families, hero's parties, merchant houses, and the looming threat beyond the frontier define the political landscape. Magic is colorful, abundant, and spectacular. Social hierarchy runs from F-rank novices to S-rank legends, with guild ranks displayed on adventurer cards that every receptionist checks. Romance blooms between dungeon dives, rivalries ignite over quest board bounties, and the bathhouse is where half the important conversations happen. This is the realm where isekai protagonists thrive — and where the world hasn't learned your name yet."
    },
