      "known": false,
      "name": "Grim Dark Fantasy",
      "basicInfo": "## Basic Info\nA brutal, morally grey world of scarcity and survival. Magic costs blood, sanity, or worse. Heroism is rare and expensive. Placeholder realm; not yet available for play."
