      "realm": "Anime Fantasy",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 1,
      "basicInfo": "The wilderland between Solasreach's eastern border and Caelvir's tree line — a stretch of rough hills, overgrown trails, and disputed territory that neither kingdom can fully claim. The Marches are dotted with abandoned watchtowers, crumbling noble manors, and the occasional fortified outpost still holding on. Monster dens honeycomb the hills. The Adventurers' Guild maintains a handful of waystations, and the Crossroads Inn is the only reliable shelter between the two kingdoms. Bandits, deserters, and those who do not want to be found live here. So do hot-spring oases that make the danger almost worth it.",
