          "description": "A modest gathering hall of pale timber and warm stone, centered on a fuel-less hearth whose flame follows the Basin's current color. A long table, development board, and work ledgers preserve the hall's established function for actual residents. Sliding panels open onto foxfire clover and the irrigation garden; empty places remain empty until someone truly lives here.",
