      "x": 15.75269119345812,
      "y": -14.24730880654188,
      "basicInfo": "A cave system in the southern hills named for the wind that pours through its entrance chambers — a constant, eerie howl that ranges from whisper to shriek depending on the weather. The Hollow is a D-rank dungeon: wolf packs in the outer chambers, territorial cave-bears in the middle, and something larger that the howling never quite drowns out in the deepest passages. Adventurers come for the monster-core deposits and the rare luminescent fungi. The smart ones leave before dusk.",
