      "basicInfo": "A peaceful farming village in the western Lowlands — green fields, stone cottages, and the kind of quiet contentment that makes adventurers wonder if they chose the right career. Greenmeadow produces the Lowlands' best wool and cheese, and the villagers are friendly, practical, and mildly amused by adventurers who pass through looking for quests. The only excitement here is the annual Harvest Fair, which features dancing, drinking, and a surprising number of romances between visitors and locals.",
