      "basicInfo": "A library-city in the canopy — the continent's largest repository of elven knowledge, housed in a grove of ancient trees whose living branches form shelves, reading alcoves, and winding staircases of woven vine. The Archive holds records stretching back millennia: spell-craft treatises, ecological surveys, diplomatic correspondences, and a restricted root-level collection that even most elves cannot access. Scholars from every kingdom petition for access; few are granted. Those who enter never forget the sound of wind through ten thousand pages.",
