        "higashi-no-in": {
          "description": "The eastern hall — kōdō incense ceremony chamber, a ritual room, and a calligraphy garden used for rites and instruction in the divine arts. Brush, inkstone, and seasonal flowers are always in correct arrangement.",
          "paths": [
            "central-pavilion"
