        },
        "estate-court": {
          "description": "The open arrival court inside the Mon — raked white gravel, a still mirror pool, foxfire lantern posts, and the quiet bustle of masked attendants at the estate's edges. Tsukiko's household favors restraint, cleanliness, precise hospitality, and harmony: offerings are arranged correctly, paths are swept without visible labor, and every bow carries the weight of old court etiquette. Everything here is serene and disciplined; nothing is ever out of place.",
