        "garden-of-moonlight": {
          "description": "A moonlit garden of deliberate arrangement adjoining the mirror lake — pines, maples, shide streamers, and a spring of clear water below sweeping bamboo. Stone foxes in red bibs watch from mossy pedestals. Paths cross in shimenawa-bound silence; the foxfire here is brightest at full moon, when the wordless prayers rise.",
