    "Great Prairie": {
      "name": "Great Prairie",
      "basicInfo": "The vast prairie heart of The Deep Expanse—firm ground under a high clear sky, threaded by tall blue-green grasses that wave in slow unison and hum in layered chords as the wind passes. It is the largest single open ecosystem in the Demi-Plane: deep-rooted, herd-crossed, and broad enough that walking it takes a full day while the horizon remains exactly as distant.\n\nLiving Ecology: At night the grass tips reproduce the sky in cobalt points, and grasswhales move beneath them like low, breathing hills. Wide herd circuits braid the whole southern ecosystem together.",
      "x": 25,
