    "Golden Walk": {
      "name": "Golden Walk",
      "basicInfo": "The ridge path along the highest crest of The Southroll — a spontaneous footpath the dimension seems to have worn for the pleasure of it, winding hilltop to hilltop through perpetual golden light. Warm-feather birds roost along its length, grass spirits part the growth a stride ahead of walkers, and from the crest's center the whole dimension is faintly visible: a pocket-sized world laid out under endless afternoon.\n\nLiving Ecology: The crest path glows rose-gold beneath each footfall, then dims behind it as fireflies close the trail in ordered spirals. Prairie wind arrives on one side and Rift-cool air on the other.",
      "x": 15,
      "y": 25,
