      "region": "The Westreach",
      "complexityType": "simple",
      "detailType": "detailed",
      "known": true,
      "hiddenInfo": "The dimension pre-built the firepit overnight and the Chamberlain cannot bring himself to move it — it chose the exact spot his own sketches did. Foxfire dew collects here more thickly than anywhere nearby, suggesting the site wants guests welcomed and rested. Harmless sprites have taken up residence in the saved trees, and they rearrange the stakes slightly when they think his spacing is wrong. One territorial spirit beast guards the slope's western edge and must be acknowledged before any construction passes it.\n\nEcological Continuity: The land anticipates hospitality as usable terrain, not as automatic guests. No visitor learns of or enters the Demi-Plane without established permission and access.",
