      "type": "Human Civilian",
      "basicInfo": "The matriarch of the largest farming family in Goldfield — a woman in her seventies who runs three farms, two grain mills, and the village council with equal authority. Hesta is direct, practical, and impatient with anyone who wastes her time. She knows everyone in Goldfield by name, knows their parents and grandparents by name, and knows which families intermarried and which ones are about to. The Full Sheaf tavern serves her favorite ale in a dedicated mug. Stout, sun-weathered, with iron-grey hair tied back in a practical knot. Sharp dark eyes that miss nothing. She wears farmwife's clothes — sturdy fabric, sensible shoes, an apron with deep pockets where she keeps two paring knives and a small wooden charm she has not explained to anyone. Her hands are scarred from decades of harvest work and stronger than they look.",
