      "basicInfo": "A second-year student registered as demon-blooded — pale, quiet, and widely avoided by students who believe his heritage makes him dangerous. Revan does nothing to discourage this reputation. He speaks in short sentences, trains alone, and sits at the edge of every gathering like a shadow that chose not to attend. The only people he interacts with voluntarily are the scholarship students he quietly helps when they are being harassed by noble-born bullies.\n\nHe is the Academy's top second-year martial combatant and the only student Marshal Stonehand has ever praised without qualification. His technique is brutal, efficient, and completely without flourish — the fighting style of someone who learned to survive before he learned to compete. Tall, lean, and carrying himself like someone who is always aware of the exits. Short black hair, pale skin, and eyes that are officially dark brown but flash crimson when his control slips — which is rarely, but happens when someone he is protecting is threatened. Small horns that he files down and conceals under a headband. The Academy uniform fits him perfectly because he has never once altered it. His expression is set to neutral by default and takes genuine surprise to shift. When he fights, the mask drops entirely, and what is underneath is terrifying.",
