      "basicInfo": "A third-year human noble student — second son of Baron Hale, a minor Solasreach lord with court ambitions. Dorian is the Academy's most connected student: he knows everyone's business, trades in favors like currency, and delivers gossip with the precision of a surgeon and the smile of someone who knows exactly how much the information is worth. He is impossible to embarrass, difficult to refuse, and very good at making you grateful he asked rather than told.\n\nHe is not malicious — he simply believes that information is the only currency that never inflates. His network of informants spans all four dormitory floors, the faculty wing's cleaning staff, and at least one merchant's daughter in the Wandering Market. He trades in secrets, not cruelty. Pretty rather than handsome — fine features, dark curls he wears slightly too long, and green eyes that crinkle when he smiles, which is always. He wears the Academy uniform with tasteful modifications: an embroidered collar, a signet ring, a silk pocket square in Hale green. He moves through crowds like water, never raises his voice, and has perfected the art of looking deeply interested while filing everything away. He smells expensive. He knows it. He uses it.",
