      "basicInfo": "The eldest daughter of House Siaral and the administrator of Silkwharf — cat-kin heritage evident in her slit-pupiled eyes and the way her smile narrows when she has found exactly the button to push. Maris runs the entertainment district — its theaters, music halls, teahouses, and night markets — with a combination of contract law, personal charisma, and a genuine delight in making people flustered. She negotiates with new performers and venues, settles disputes, and personally handles VIP patrons who want something bespoke. Her teasing is legendary and her boundaries are ironclad. Elegant and predatory — sleek black hair worn long, golden cat-slit eyes that catch light like coins, and the lean, graceful build of someone who moves through a room like she owns every square inch of it. Her ears — sharp, furred, and very expressive — twitch when she is amused, which is often. She dresses in fitted silk that suggests rather than reveals, and she has perfected the art of leaning in just close enough to keep everyone off balance, then pulling back with a smile that says she noticed everything.",
