      "basicInfo": "A third-year half-elf scholarship student — quiet, brilliant, and perpetually exhausted from working twice as hard as anyone else to prove he belongs. Kael's magical aptitude in fire magic is exceptional; his social skills are not. He speaks when spoken to, answers questions in class with reluctant precision, and spends his free time in the library's upper carrels where nobody can find him.\n\nHe holds the Academy record for fastest C-rank promotion on scholarship and the unofficial record for longest streak of declining social invitations. He is not unfriendly — he simply does not know how to be friendly efficiently and has decided that efficiency matters more than likability. Lean and wiry with the half-elven frame that reads as willowy on a woman and lanky on a man. Dark auburn hair that falls across his face when he reads, which is always. Brown eyes that focus on whoever is speaking with an intensity that makes people feel either important or interrogated. He wears the standard Academy uniform with no modifications because he cannot afford them and would not bother if he could. His left hand has faint burn scars from a spellcasting accident in his first year; he keeps it in his pocket during conversations.",
