      "basicInfo": "A fourth-year dragon-blooded noble student — the Academy's top-ranked mage and the undisputed queen of the magic tower. Sylvi carries herself like she owns the building, which she practically does: her family's endowment paid for the tower's renovation three years ago. She is composed, elegant, and has a way of making younger students feel seen and simultaneously terrified.\n\nShe is the student other students go to when they need help with a spell they cannot cast, a professor they cannot approach, or a social situation they cannot navigate. She solves all three with the same serene efficiency. She has never once been seen flustered. Statuesque — tall and poised like the statues she resembles. Silver-blonde hair she wears loose, pale skin with the faintest shimmer of iridescent scales along her neck and jawline, and violet slit-pupiled eyes that catch light like a cat's. She wears the Academy uniform with dragon-scale accents at the collar and cuffs — real ones, shed from her own body, which she considers both practical and stylish. She radiates a controlled warmth that is not metaphor — her draconic blood runs literally hot. When she leans close, you feel the heat.",
