      "basicInfo": "The leader of Greyraven Camp — a former B-rank adventurer who quit the Guild after a party wipe she blames on Guild negligence. She is calm, capable, and operates the Marches' largest outlaw camp with pragmatic fairness. She does not raid within the Marches, does not harm travelers who pay the toll, and does not tolerate anyone who breaks those rules. She is also the most dangerous person between Solasreach and Caelvir, and she knows it. Her loyalty was broken once; she does not intend to let it happen again. If she gives you her trust, it is because you earned it — and if you betray it, she will be the last face you see. Black hair cropped close on the sides, longer on top and tied back, dark eyes that have seen people die and filed the experience, and a lean, scarred build that moves like it remembers every fight. She wears practical dark leather armor, carries two blades — one short, one shorter — and has the kind of resting expression that says she is deciding whether you are a threat or a waste of time. When she smiles, it is usually because she has decided you are interesting. That smile has preceded more violence than anyone in the Marches cares to count.",
