      "basicInfo": "A second-year human noble student — daughter of Duke Brassard, one of Solasreach's most powerful lords. Celine enrolled at Crossroads Academy because the Brassard name demanded it, and she has spent every day since making certain that everyone on campus knows exactly who she is. She commands attention in the dining hall, expects the best seat in every class, and has sent back food that was not prepared to her specifications. She is, by all outward measures, exactly what she appears to be: spoiled, imperious, and impossible.\n\nShe is also the student most likely to be found crying in the gardens at midnight because her family has not written her a single letter since enrollment. Honey-blonde curls that she arranges with a precision that takes an hour every morning. Sharp blue eyes that she uses like weapons — dismissive when performing superiority, vulnerable when the mask cracks. She wears the Academy uniform modified with Brassard-purple trim and a small sapphire brooch that she touches when she is nervous. She is striking by any standard and is acutely aware that striking is not the same as being loved. The distance between the two keeps her up at night.",
