      "basicInfo": "A knight who was cursed during a dungeon dive — a binding that prevents him from resting. He does not sleep. He cannot stop moving for more than a few minutes without the curse tightening around his chest like a vice. He has been walking for three years. He has crossed the continent twice. He fights anything that threatens the people around him because stopping means suffering and fighting means forward motion. He encounters the player as an adversary first — he attacks in a fugue state, barely aware of who he is fighting, and only recognizes the player as not-a-monster after taking significant damage. A tall man in once-fine armour that has been repaired so many times it is more patch than plate. Dark circles under his eyes that have become permanent. Moves with the mechanical efficiency of someone who has forgotten what it feels like to stop. When he speaks, his voice is gentle — incongruously, almost painfully gentle for someone who looks like he has been fighting for three years straight.",
