          "instruction": "A named NPC has sworn fealty to the player. This is a significant moment — narrate the weight of the oath and its immediate effect. If the player has the \"Demi-Plane — Awakened\" trait and this is the FIRST NPC to swear fealty, the Demi-Plane awakens: describe the pocket dimension coming into existence, the Chamberlain manifesting, and the Demi-Plane Anchor item appearing in the player's inventory. Grant the player the \"Demi-Plane Gate\" ability and \"Demi-Plane Anchor\" item if they do not already have them. If the player already has a Demi-Plane (Innate or previously Awakened), this new oath-sworn expands the Demi-Plane slightly and unlocks a development category based on their skills. The Chamberlain should acknowledge the new resident and suggest how they might contribute.",
          "type": "story"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Fealty Sworn",
      "recurring": true
    },
