        "Tsukiko Kuzunoha": "Step into stride with the Chamberlain, your expression serious but warm. “One thing before we go over the rules. This is a fox realm, and my kin come first, but that does not mean they are free from guilt or punishment. Judgment will always be fair and equal; the law applies to all even if outsiders have to accept additional rules due to being outsiders and for the Realms protection.”"
