        "Tsukiko Kuzunoha": "I pat Zeryth \"You did well, dear. Thank you. Please go back to the chamberlain for now.\" Then i turn to dorian \"Are you slow or stupid? How many times have i said i do not want nor need commentary and yet you keep doing it. SAVE. IT. Or better yet, leave before i lose my temper.\" Then i turn to Kaelen desperation? Please. Do not mistaken your mortal flaws with me perfectly answering your questions. The first proposition was, and i quote: 'Proposition one: all order is a cage, and every cage is built by fear. State whether you agree — or demonstrate that you do not, and be measured by how.' And i answered. I said i do not agree by, as asked, demonstrating. My own servant answered honestly about my order. Do you doubt my answer? If so, then you failed in your own duty after i did exactly what was asked of me.\""
