        "Tsukiko Kuzunoha": "I kill kaelen with Word of Unmaking and then sigh \"Gods how i despise people like him. Acting like they know it all while not knowing anything. As for you, Verifier, i will ask you once and you better answer literal, short, and honest. How do you know about my realm and what i spoke about with ny Chamberlain. If you use more words than needed to answer then you will follow Kaelen.\""
