            {
              "characterName": "Zeryth",
              "action": "Zeryth pulses with a rhythmic, iridescent tremor, its spikes elongating as it shifts its weight toward Vassago. It seems to be savoring the sudden vacuum of power and the ensuing terror in the Verifier's eyes.",
